{
  "uid": "ledger-demo",
  "title": "ledger-demo",
  "description": "The API's requests by route and the payment pipeline's transitions (slice 5, contracts/telemetry.md). Each series links to its traces in Tempo; each trace to the next (process -> publish -> request). Rates miss what a process counts before its first export (each start is a new series), so they dip a little across restarts: for trends; exact counts come from the database (the slice 5 spec, Known gaps).",
  "tags": [
    "ledger-demo"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": false,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "API requests (http.server.request.duration)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by route",
      "description": "Requests per second, by route template (both implementations).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_route!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Traces for ${__field.labels.http_route}",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.http.route%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.http_route}%5C%22%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Errors by route",
      "description": "Responses with a 4xx or 5xx status, per second, by route and status.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (http_route, http_response_status_code) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{http_response_status_code=~\"[45]..\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}} {{http_response_status_code}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Failed requests' traces for ${__field.labels.http_route}",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.http.route%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.http_route}%5C%22%20%26%26%20span.http.response.status_code%20%3E%3D%20400%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "p95 duration by route",
      "description": "The 95th percentile of request duration, by route template.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, http_route) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{http_route!=\"\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{http_route}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Traces for ${__field.labels.http_route}",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.http.route%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.http_route}%5C%22%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "The pipeline (ledger_transitions_total)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transitions by step",
      "description": "Applied, committed status transitions per second, by entity and step (from none: a creation), and implementation.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (entity, from, to, implementation) (rate(ledger_transitions_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{entity}} {{from}} → {{to}} ({{implementation}})",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Processing traces (${__field.labels.implementation})",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.messaging.operation.name%20%3D%20%5C%22process%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.implementation%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.implementation}%5C%22%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transitions by implementation",
      "description": "Applied transitions per second, by the implementation that applied them (a mixed stack shows both).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 10,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (implementation) (rate(ledger_transitions_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{implementation}}",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Processing traces (${__field.labels.implementation})",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.messaging.operation.name%20%3D%20%5C%22process%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.implementation%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.implementation}%5C%22%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transitions by instance",
      "description": "The same rate split by process instance (service.instance.id, Prometheus's instance label) and implementation, to show how workers share the work: e.g. two deposit-workers on one consumer. The legend's host is the container ID (host.name, joined from target_info). The panels above aggregate across instances on purpose.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "range": true,
          "expr": "sum by (job, instance, implementation, host_name) (rate(ledger_transitions_total[$__rate_interval]) * on (job, instance) group_left (host_name) target_info)",
          "legendFormat": "{{job}} {{implementation}} {{host_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Processing traces (${__field.labels.implementation})",
              "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes={%22a%22%3A{%22datasource%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B{%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A{%22type%22%3A%22tempo%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22tempo%22}%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22traceql%22%2C%22query%22%3A%22{%20span.messaging.operation.name%20%3D%20%5C%22process%5C%22%20%26%26%20resource.implementation%20%3D%20%5C%22${__field.labels.implementation}%5C%22%20}%22%2C%22limit%22%3A20}%5D%2C%22range%22%3A{%22from%22%3A%22${__from}%22%2C%22to%22%3A%22${__to}%22}}}"
            }
          ],
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
